14. TASK 10 — 14-DAY RETURN WINDOW
============================================================

Implement the agreed business rule:

DELIVERED
→ 14-DAY RETURN WINDOW
→ RETURN AVAILABLE

After 14 days:

RETURN WINDOW CLOSED

The calculation must be based on the actual delivered timestamp.

Not:

order creation time

Not:

payment time

Not:

purchase time

The system must not accidentally reset the return window when the order is edited.

The return status must remain associated with the order.

============================================================
15. TASK 11 — AUTOMATIC RETURN CLOSURE
============================================================

Orders whose return period has expired must automatically move to the appropriate closed/expired state.

Do not delete the order.

Do not delete transaction history.

Do not delete billing information.

Do not delete payment information.

Do not delete inventory history.

The order must remain available for historical/audit purposes.

Only the active return window/action must close.

